      "problem": "$|\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 & 1 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 5 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 7 & 0 \\\\ 5 & -2 & 4 & 3\\end{aligned}|=$",
